{"type": "spr", "stem": "<figure class=\"table\"><table border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 47.6236%; text-align: center;\" scope=\"col\">Shape</th>\n<th style=\"width: 47.7844%; text-align: center;\" scope=\"col\">Number of cards</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.6236%; text-align: left;\">Square</td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.7844%; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"5\"><mn>5</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.6236%; text-align: left;\">Circle</td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.7844%; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.6236%; text-align: left;\">Triangle</td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.7844%; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"14\"><mn>14</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.6236%; text-align: left;\">Star</td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.7844%; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"12\"><mn>12</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The table summarizes the distribution of shape printed on one side for cards in a deck of cards. How many cards in the deck have a triangle printed on one side?</p>", "keys": ["14"], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"14\"><mn>14</mn>\n</math>. The table summarizes the distribution of shape printed on one side for cards in a deck of cards. The table shows that the number of cards when the shape is a triangle is <math alttext=\"14\"><mn>14</mn>\n</math>. Therefore, there are <math alttext=\"14\"><mn>14</mn>\n</math> cards in the deck that have a triangle printed on one side.</p>", "externalid": "862ae133-b6b4-494f-a4f0-2a3ec7706432", "correct_answer": ["14"]}